{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"g1","type":"group","x":-540,"y":-360,"width":1710,"height":420,"label":"1. Pembuatan Stimulus Audio Terisolasi (Bab III Subbab 3.6.1 - 3.6.2)"},
		{"id":"g2","type":"group","x":-540,"y":200,"width":1710,"height":320,"label":"2. Rekrutmen, Etika UU PDP, & Pengambilan Data (Bab III Subbab 3.6.3, 3.6.4, 3.6.6)"},
		{"id":"g3","type":"group","x":-540,"y":720,"width":1710,"height":320,"label":"3. Uji Reliabilitas, Statistik MOS, & Korelasi Objektif-Subjektif (Bab III Subbab 3.6.5)"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","text":"### 3. Counterbalanced Blind Randomization\n`[Bab III 3.6.1]`\n\n- Responden **tidak tahu** algoritma penghasil A/B\n- Urutan A vs B diacak seimbang untuk cegah bias urutan","x":830,"y":-260,"width":310,"height":255,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","text":"### 2. Audio Stitching Klip 30 Detik\n`[Bab III 3.6.2, Eq. 3.11]`\n\n- **15s outro** $L_j$ + **15s intro** $L_{j+1}$\n- Dibuat 2 versi untuk pasangan sama:\n  - **Versi A:** Model Usulan\n  - **Versi B:** Baseline Gaur","x":205,"y":-260,"width":350,"height":255,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"### 1. Seleksi 6 Pasang Transisi\n`[Bab III 3.6.2]`\n\n- 2 pasang rute diagonal (**Q3 $\\to$ Q1**)\n- 2 pasang rute relaksasi (**Q1 $\\to$ Q4**)\n- 2 pasang rute naik energi (**Q4 $\\to$ Q1**)","x":-380,"y":-240,"width":340,"height":215,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","text":"### 4. Sampling & Etika (UU PDP)\n`[Bab III 3.6.3 & 3.6.6]`\n\n- Minimal **$N \\ge 30$ responden** (19–25 thn, pendengar aktif $\\ge 1$ jam/hari)\n- *Informed consent* tertulis (15–20 menit)\n- Anonimisasi `R01–R30` (**UU PDP No. 27/2022**)","x":-420,"y":220,"width":340,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"n5","type":"text","text":"### 5. Sesi Dengar Terstandar\n`[Bab III 3.6.3]`\n\n- Ruang tenang, headphone tertutup\n- Tingkat volume terkalibrasi **65–70 dB SPL**\n- Memutar 6 pasang stimulus (A & B)","x":205,"y":253,"width":340,"height":212,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"n6","type":"text","text":"### 6. Kuesioner Likert 5 Poin\n`[Bab III 3.6.4]`\n\nMenilai 3 dimensi persepsi:\n1. *Transition smoothness*\n2. *Acoustic & energy continuity*\n3. *Emotional naturalness*","x":780,"y":250,"width":320,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","text":"### 7. Uji Reliabilitas Instrumen\n`[Bab III 3.6.5, Eq. 3.12]`\n\n- Hitung **Cronbach's Alpha**:\n  $$\\alpha \\ge 0,70$$\n- Memastikan konsistensi internal jawaban responden","x":-420,"y":770,"width":340,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","text":"### 8. Uji Beda MOS (Wilcoxon)\n`[Bab III 3.6.5]`\n\n- *Wilcoxon Signed-Rank Test* ($\\alpha = 0,05$)\n- Uji hipotesis:\n  $$\\mathrm{MOS}_{\\mathrm{Usulan}} > \\mathrm{MOS}_{\\mathrm{Gaur}}$$","x":240,"y":770,"width":350,"height":215,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"n9","type":"text","text":"### 9. Korelasi Spearman ($r_s$)\n`[Bab III 3.6.5, Eq. 3.13]`\n\n- Uji keselarasan metrik objektif ($\\mathcal{S}$, $\\mathcal{BJC}$) dengan MOS manusia\n- Menjawab **RM 3** secara tuntas","x":820,"y":770,"width":310,"height":215,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"n1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"n2","toSide":"left","label":"6 pasang"},
